# This directory holds dynamically generated Ontop configuration files
# Files generated at runtime:
# - ocel_mapping.obda: OBDA mapping file (generated by OCELSchemaInferrer)
# - ocel.properties: Database connection properties (generated by OCELSchemaInferrer)
#
# The Ontop service in Docker always points to these fixed filenames here,
# allowing the Python code to generate mappings dynamically for different datasets
